# Stage Public API + AI Integration — Full Plan
http://127.0.0.1:4174/dev-handoff/index.html


## Work Split

### This session (Claude) — Frontend & Design
- Developer tab in Settings (API key management UI)
- API Docs page at `/docs` (Stepps-style: sidebar nav, method badges, code tabs)
- OpenClaw landing page at `/openclaw`
- `stage-api-docs.ts` data file (like Stepps' `agent-api-docs.ts`)
- SKILL.md file for Claude Code / ClawHub

### Other AI session (Convex) — Backend & Routing
- Hono with Convex router layer on `http.ts`
- API route handlers (projects, phases, tasks CRUD)
- API key auth middleware (bearer token → userId lookup)
- AI project generation endpoint (`/api/v1/projects/generate`)
- Rate limiting for external API
- MCP server (later phase)

