## Phase 1: `stage-api-docs.ts` — API Endpoint Data File

**What:** Data-driven endpoint definitions (same architecture as Stepps' `agent-api-docs.ts`).

**File:** `app/src/lib/stage-api-docs.ts`

**Defines:**
- `ApiEndpointDoc[]` — all Stage API endpoints with method, path, fields, examples
- `ApiSectionDoc[]` — doc sections (intro, auth, projects, phases, tasks, models, examples)
- Base URL: `https://getstage.co/api/v1`
- Key prefix: `stg_`

**Sections & Endpoints:**

| Section | Endpoints |
|---------|-----------|
| API Keys (session auth) | POST create, GET list, DELETE revoke |
| Projects (bearer auth) | GET list, GET by id, POST create, POST generate (AI) |
| Phases (bearer auth) | GET list by project, POST create |
| Tasks (bearer auth) | GET list by phase, POST create, POST toggle |

**This file is the single source of truth** — consumed by both the docs page renderer AND the SKILL.md generator.

---

## Phase 2: Developer Tab in Settings

**What:** New "Developer" tab in Settings. Pro-only (free users see upgrade prompt).

**Files to modify:**
- `app/src/types/settings.ts` — add `"developer"` to `SettingsTab` union
- `app/src/features/settings/useSettingsTabs.ts` — add to valid tabs
- `app/src/components/settings/SettingsPage.tsx` — add sidebar button + render

**File to create:**
- `app/src/components/settings/DeveloperTab.tsx`

**UI:**
```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  API Keys                                    │
│  Create keys to access the Stage API.        │
│  Keys are shown once — store them securely.  │
│                                              │
│  ┌─ Key List ──────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │  stg_...a3f8  "My Agent"    2d ago     │ │
│  │  Last used: today            [Revoke]  │ │
│  │                                        │ │
│  │  stg_...b2c1  "Claude Code"  5d ago    │ │
│  │  Last used: never            [Revoke]  │ │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
│                                              │
│  [+ Create API Key]                          │
│                                              │
│  On create → dialog with name input          │
│  On success → one-time key reveal + copy btn │
│                                              │
│  Links:                                      │
│  📖 Read the API docs → /docs                │
│  🔗 View on ClawHub                          │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Backend:** Already done in `apiKeys.ts` (generate, list, revoke, max 5 keys, SHA-256 hashing).

---

## Phase 3: API Docs Page

**What:** Public page at `/docs`, matching Stepps pattern exactly.

**Files to create:**
- `app/src/routes/docs.tsx` — public route (no auth)
- `app/src/components/api-docs/ApiDocsPage.tsx` — renderer

**Layout:** Sidebar nav (sections + endpoint sub-items with method badges) | Main content (scrolling sections with code tabs).

**Features (matching Stepps):**
- Sidebar with section headers + endpoint items with GET/POST/DELETE badges
- Active section highlighting on scroll
- 3-language code tabs: cURL, TypeScript, Python
- Request body field tables (name, type, required, description)
- JSON response examples with syntax highlighting
- Dark mode support
- Mobile responsive

**Public & crawlable:** No auth required. AI agents can crawl it.

---

## Phase 4: SKILL.md

**What:** Claude Code / OpenClaw skill file.

**File:** `app/public/SKILL.md` (served as static file, downloadable)

**Structure:**
```yaml
---
name: stage
description: Manage creative projects in Stage — create projects
  with phases and tasks, track progress, toggle completions
requiredEnv:
  - STAGE_API_KEY
---

# Stage API

Base URL: https://getstage.co/api/v1
Auth: Authorization: Bearer $STAGE_API_KEY

## Endpoints
[all endpoints with curl examples, field descriptions, response shapes]

## Project Types
branding | web-design | product-design | app-design | packaging |
motion-design | illustration | other

## Example Flows
[3-4 end-to-end scenarios like the ones in stage-api-plan.md]
```

